Beeg worm 🪱 and demon horses 🐴; followed by funny, racoon man 🦝; followed by a court case that frustrates me.

#truckerlife #DnD

@nba.com @espn.com WHY?!? I’m a diehard #NBA fan. I couldn’t stay up for DEN-OKC, but SO EXCITED to watch this morning. But ~1m, 20s into the #ESPN game, across my screen scrolls:

“Thunder outlast Nuggets in OT in SGA’s return” 🤬🤬🤬

Do you think fans want to see the outcome of games we’re watching?
